OL,3,GNEWSAFather of Muckamore patient calls
OL,4,Afor 'urgency' in implementation of
OL,5,Arecommended changes
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe father of one of the patients who
OL,8,Fsuffered abuse at a hospital for
OL,9,Fvulnerable adults has said he would
OL,10,Flike "urgency injected into the
OL,11,Fprocess" of implementing an inquiry's
OL,12,Frecommendations.
OL,14,FA number of long-term patients at
OL,15,FMuckamore Abbey Hospital suffered
OL,16,Fphysical abuse, including black eyes,
OL,17,Fbroken bones, bruising and excessive
OL,18,Frestraint.
OL,20,FThe long-awaited final report into the
OL,21,Fabuse at the hospital was published in
OL,22,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
