OL,3,GNEWSAFather of Muckamore patient calls
OL,4,Afor 'urgency' in implementation of
OL,5,Arecommended changes
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Health Minister Robbie Butler, who
OL,8,Fmet some of the families of patients on
OL,9,FWednesday, said the department hopes to
OL,10,F"provide a full response in advance of
OL,11,Fthe six-month timescale set by the
OL,12,Finquiry".
